   "en": "Li Qiang, Cai Qi and Ding Xuexiang, who are members of the Standing Committee of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee, attended the symposium. Entrusted by the CPC Central Committee, Li Qiang briefed the participants on the performance of this year's economic work and shared considerations regarding economic work for the coming year.",
