   "idx": 6,
   "zh": "习近平指出，今年是很不平凡的一年，中共中央团结带领全党全国各族人民迎难而上、奋力拼搏，统筹国内国际两个大局，实施更加积极有为的宏观政策，经济社会发展主要目标将顺利完成。过去5年，我们有效应对各种冲击挑战，推动党和国家事业取得新的重大成就，“十四五”即将圆满收官，我国经济实力、科技实力、综合国力跃上新台阶。",
   "en": "Xi pointed out that in 2025, a truly extraordinary year, the CPC Central Committee united and led the entire Party and people of all ethnic groups to meet challenges head-on and strive forward. By keeping in mind both domestic and international imperatives and implementing more proactive and impactful macro policies, we will successfully fulfill the main economic and social development targets. Over the past five years, we have effectively dealt with various challenges, secured new major achievements in the cause of the Party and the country. With the 14th Five-Year Plan period (2021-2025) successfully concluding, China has ascended to new heights in economic strength, scientific and technological capabilities, and composite national power.",
