   "idx": 9,
   "zh": "习近平对各民主党派、全国工商联和无党派人士提出3点希望。一是深入学习领会中共二十届四中全会精神。把中共中央的战略部署领会准、理解透，始终同中国共产党想在一起、站在一起、干在一起。二是积极踊跃为制定实施“十五五”规划献计出力。围绕建设现代化产业体系、因地制宜发展新质生产力、建设强大国内市场等深入开展调研，提出有价值、有分量的意见建议。三是凝心聚力推动经济稳定向好。协助党和政府做好政策宣传、解疑释惑、凝聚共识的工作，引导广大成员和所联系群众坚定信心、振奋精神，营造良好发展氛围。",
   "en": "Xi put forward three hopes for the non-CPC political parties, the ACFIC, and prominent figures without party affiliation. First, they should thoroughly study and fully understand the guiding principles of the Fourth Plenary Session of the 20th CPC Central Committee, accurately grasp and fully comprehend the strategic plans of the CPC Central Committee, and always think, stand, and act along with the CPC. Second, they should take active part in contributing ideas and efforts to the formulation and implementation of the 15th Five-Year Plan. In this regard, they are expected to conduct in-depth fact-finding missions on issues such as building a modern industrial system, developing new quality productive forces in light of local conditions, and building a strong domestic market, so as to put forward valuable and weighty opinions and suggestions. Third, they should close ranks to help sustain the momentum of steady economic growth. They are expected to assist the CPC and the government in communicating policies, dispelling doubts and misgivings, and building consensus, and to guide their members and the groups they are in contact with in strengthening confidence and boosting morale, thus fostering a sound atmosphere for development.",
